      "writtenOn": "2019-11-26T06:08:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What operations need to have a wait after? Is it just erasing? If so, could we instead place this after the erase call to spi_transaction() below?\n\nOr is it after reading and erasing? If so, should we add one in the inner while loop after a call to spi_nor_read_internal()?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 694,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 697,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "52a663712ce14af405b7fcf38275066aed9189e0",
