        "filename": "common/spi_nor.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 697,
      "author": {
        "id": 1167634
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-11-26T22:04:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So it sounds like the real requirements are that we wait before reading or erasing, and as a courtesy to the caller we should wait before returning. SGTM. Also looks like the spi_nor_wait() call pattern here now matches that used in spi_nor_write().",
      "parentUuid": "f19a05fb_7caca248",
